    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Easy Tabs Block</strong> is a lightweight, flexible plugin for building responsive tabbed content in WordPress. Designed for both beginners and developers, it integrates seamlessly with the Gutenberg editor while keeping your site fast and clutter-free.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Multiple Layouts:</strong> Horizontal for simplicity, vertical for sidebars, or edge-aligned for unique designs, all without code.</li>\n<li><strong>Complete Style Control:</strong> Customize colors, typography, spacing, and hover/active states via the block sidebar.</li>\n<li><strong>Rich Content Support:</strong> Add text, images, videos, HTML, or <strong>any Gutenberg block</strong> inside tabs.</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive Design:</strong> Your content reshapes flawlessly for mobile visitors. No extra work is needed.</li>\n<li><strong>Smooth Animations:</strong> Add fade, slide, or zoom effects to tab transitions.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Patterns:</strong> Import pre-designed patterns in one click.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>easy-tabs-block</code> folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Installed Plugins</strong>.</li>\n<li>Add the <strong>Easy Tabs Block</strong> via the block inserter.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20%5Bx%5D%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with [X] theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>EasyTabsBlock works seamlessly with all Gutenberg-ready themes. For the best experience, we recommend modern block-based themes like Twenty Twenty-Five, Twenty Twenty-Four, Twenty Twenty-Three, or Astra.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='do%20patterns%20require%20customization%3F'>\nDo patterns require customization?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! Patterns include dummy content/images for demonstration. Replace them with your own, and adjust margins/padding to match your theme’s styling.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='do%20i%20need%20coding%20skills%20to%20customize%20the%20tabs%3F'>\nDo I need coding skills to customize the tabs?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No coding required! You can fully customize your tabs using the intuitive block settings &#8211; adjust colors, spacing, typography, and more with simple clicks. All changes happen in real-time through the visual editor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20use%20templates%20with%20icons%3F'>\nHow do I use templates with icons?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Some patterns require the free <strong><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/icon-block/\" rel=\"ugc\">Icon Block</a></strong> plugin. Install it to unlock icon-based designs—it’s optional and takes 1 minute.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Build stunning, customizable tabs in Gutenberg with no code needed. 20+ pre-built templates, 1-click styling, and endless customization.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Easy Tabs Block</strong> is a lightweight, flexible plugin for building responsive tabbed content in WordPress. Designed for both beginners and developers, it integrates seamlessly with the Gutenberg editor while keeping your site fast and clutter-free.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Multiple Layouts:</strong> Horizontal for simplicity, vertical for sidebars, or edge-aligned for unique designs, all without code.</li>\n<li><strong>Complete Style Control:</strong> Customize colors, typography, spacing, and hover/active states via the block sidebar.</li>\n<li><strong>Rich Content Support:</strong> Add text, images, videos, HTML, or <strong>any Gutenberg block</strong> inside tabs.</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive Design:</strong> Your content reshapes flawlessly for mobile visitors. No extra work is needed.</li>\n<li><strong>Smooth Animations:</strong> Add fade, slide, or zoom effects to tab transitions.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Patterns:</strong> Import pre-designed patterns in one click.</li>\n</ul>\n",
